# Datasets - not meant for git at all, regardless of size. Source of truth
# is s3://sphoorthq-geoverse/datasets/ (see notebooks/01_ingest.ipynb and
# utils/core/cloud_state.py) - local datasets/ is a working cache the app
# populates on demand (raw chips lazily via utils/ai/classic/
# sen1floods11_dataset.py, registry/job/run state via STATE_S3_BUCKET), never
# something to commit or push. This used to carve out an exception for
# datasets/metadata/ and datasets/reports/ ("small JSON, keep tracked") -
# that's gone now that S3 is the actual source of truth for that state too.
datasets/

